            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Fran"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Needed a recipe with pork and pineapple. These ingredients worked perfectly, though since I had 'fast fry pork loin chops' I used the air fryer instead of the oven cutting cook time in half ... oh and the heat setting only needed 355F. I did add lime juice to the salsa. Will definitely try with tenderloin as per original recipe",
