            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sharon Dyson-Demers"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was a big hit. The pork was perfectly cooked... juicy and delicious. This is a super easy pineapple salsa recipe. I removed seeds and membrane and the salsa had the perfect amount of heat. Definitely a keeper!",
